1
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,700
The river keeps no name.
It waits for no one.

2
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:19,400
He crossed it the only way he knew —
lightly.

3
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:26,300
Halfway over,
the river rose to meet him.

4
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:39,200
Draw a sword to cut the water…

5
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,950
…and the water only flows on.
